  &lt;main style=&quot;padding:28px 24px 36px;&quot;&gt;
    &lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 26px;padding:13px 16px;background:#e8f3f7;border-left:4px solid #0891b2;border-radius:7px;font-size:14px;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;
      以下论文按照用户研究方向的优先级排列；同一方向内优先展示相关性较高及发表时间较新的工作。
    &lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;section style=&quot;margin:0 0 34px;&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px;border-bottom:2px solid #dbe6ef;padding-bottom:9px;&quot;&gt;
        &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#b91c1c;color:#ffffff;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;h2 style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:21px;line-height:1.3;color:#102a43;&quot;&gt;Cyber Threat Intelligence (CTI)&lt;/h2&gt;
        &lt;span style=&quot;margin-left:auto;font-size:12px;color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;1 篇&lt;/span&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin:0;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dbe4ec;border-left:4px solid #dc2626;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cell.com/iscience/fulltext/S2589-0042(26)01841-9?rss=yes&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#0f4c81;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750;&quot;&gt;LLM-guided contrastive evidence mining for explainable cyber threat intelligence classification&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-bottom:11px;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#edf2f7;color:#334155;font-weight:650;&quot;&gt;iScience&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#e0f2fe;color:#075985;&quot;&gt;cyber threat intelligence (CTI)&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#fee2e2;color:#991b1b;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;高相关&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;time datetime=&quot;2026-06-24&quot; style=&quot;padding:3px 2px;color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;2026-06-24&lt;/time&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:14.5px;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;该研究聚焦网络威胁情报分类中的准确性与可解释性问题，利用&lt;strong&gt;大语言模型&lt;/strong&gt;引导对分类判定有支持或反驳作用的证据挖掘。方法将证据挖掘与&lt;strong&gt;对比学习&lt;/strong&gt;结合，使模型在识别威胁情报类别的同时提供可追溯的判定依据，从而增强&lt;strong&gt;CTI&lt;/strong&gt;分析结果的透明度及对安全分析人员的辅助价值。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;
    &lt;/section&gt;

    &lt;section style=&quot;margin:0 0 34px;&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px;border-bottom:2px solid #dbe6ef;padding-bottom:9px;&quot;&gt;
        &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#7c3aed;color:#ffffff;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;&quot;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;h2 style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:21px;line-height:1.3;color:#102a43;&quot;&gt;Explainable AI (XAI)&lt;/h2&gt;
        &lt;span style=&quot;margin-left:auto;font-size:12px;color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;2 篇&lt;/span&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin:0 0 13px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dbe4ec;border-left:4px solid #7c3aed;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://chemrxiv.org/doi/full/10.26434/chemrxiv.15005137/v1?af=R&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#0f4c81;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750;&quot;&gt;ChemicHAL – agentic explainable artificial intelligence platform for deep learning in chemistry&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-bottom:11px;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#edf2f7;color:#334155;font-weight:650;&quot;&gt;ChemRxiv&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#f3e8ff;color:#6b21a8;&quot;&gt;explainable AI (XAI)&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;中相关&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;time datetime=&quot;2026-06-24&quot; style=&quot;padding:3px 2px;color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;2026-06-24&lt;/time&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:14.5px;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;针对化学及自然科学中的深度学习预测难以被研究人员理解和验证的问题，论文设计并实现了&lt;strong&gt;ChemicHAL&lt;/strong&gt;智能体式可解释人工智能平台。该平台面向机器学习预测开展下游&lt;strong&gt;XAI&lt;/strong&gt;分析，以解释模型决策并辅助化学推理；现有摘要未给出所集成解释算法、基准数据集和定量评测结果。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin:0;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dbe4ec;border-left:4px solid #7c3aed;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://chemrxiv.org/doi/full/10.26434/chemrxiv.15005130/v1?af=R&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#0f4c81;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750;&quot;&gt;Agentic, Explainable, and Generative Artificial Intelligence for Structure-Aware Small-Molecule Drug Design&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-bottom:11px;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#edf2f7;color:#334155;font-weight:650;&quot;&gt;ChemRxiv&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#f3e8ff;color:#6b21a8;&quot;&gt;explainable AI (XAI)&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;中相关&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;time datetime=&quot;2026-06-24&quot; style=&quot;padding:3px 2px;color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;2026-06-24&lt;/time&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:14.5px;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;该文探讨小分子药物设计从静态虚拟筛选向可生成、可解释且具自主决策能力的人工智能系统转型。其核心是整合&lt;strong&gt;分子生成&lt;/strong&gt;、&lt;strong&gt;效力预测&lt;/strong&gt;、模型行为解释与&lt;strong&gt;不确定性量化&lt;/strong&gt;，以提高实验优先级排序及药物发现决策的透明度和可靠性。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;
    &lt;/section&gt;

    &lt;section style=&quot;margin:0 0 34px;&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px;border-bottom:2px solid #dbe6ef;padding-bottom:9px;&quot;&gt;
        &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#6d28d9;color:#ffffff;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;&quot;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;h2 style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:21px;line-height:1.3;color:#102a43;&quot;&gt;Interpretable Machine Learning&lt;/h2&gt;
        &lt;span style=&quot;margin-left:auto;font-size:12px;color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;2 篇&lt;/span&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin:0 0 13px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dbe4ec;border-left:4px solid #8b5cf6;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.26501&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#0f4c81;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750;&quot;&gt;Ductility Design Rules for Tungsten based Refractory High Entropy Alloys from Sparse Experimental Datasets&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-bottom:11px;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#edf2f7;color:#334155;font-weight:650;&quot;&gt;arXiv&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#ede9fe;color:#5b21b6;&quot;&gt;interpretable machine learning&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;中相关&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;time datetime=&quot;2026-06-26&quot; style=&quot;padding:3px 2px;color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;2026-06-26&lt;/time&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:14.5px;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;该研究针对钨基难熔高熵合金实验数据稀疏且室温延性难以预测的问题，构建了基于成分与物理信息描述符的机器学习分类框架，并通过嵌套交叉验证确定&lt;strong&gt;支持向量分类器（SVC）&lt;/strong&gt;具有最佳泛化性能。研究利用&lt;strong&gt;SHAP&lt;/strong&gt;解释模型决策，识别出交换关联参数、价电子浓度、压力场和电负性失配等关键因素，并发现适量&lt;strong&gt;Ti、Ni和Co&lt;/strong&gt;有利于提高延性而高&lt;strong&gt;Cr&lt;/strong&gt;含量会促进脆化，形成了可解释的候选合金筛选规则。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin:0;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dbe4ec;border-left:4px solid #8b5cf6;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.23729&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#0f4c81;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750;&quot;&gt;Interpretable Material Spatial Intelligence for Discovery of Governing Microstructural Features&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-bottom:11px;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#edf2f7;color:#334155;font-weight:650;&quot;&gt;arXiv&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#ede9fe;color:#5b21b6;&quot;&gt;interpretable machine learning&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;中相关&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;time datetime=&quot;2026-06-24&quot; style=&quot;padding:3px 2px;color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;2026-06-24&lt;/time&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:14.5px;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;该文针对材料机器学习依赖手工描述符或聚合表示、难以揭示微观空间组织机制的问题，提出&lt;strong&gt;材料空间智能框架 MSI&lt;/strong&gt;。MSI通过&lt;strong&gt;多模态表示学习&lt;/strong&gt;将高分辨率微结构和变形数据编码为保留空间关系的共享潜在表示，不仅预测材料性质，还能识别控制力学行为及性能权衡的关键特征，并支持微结构优化与机制发现。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;
    &lt;/section&gt;

    &lt;section style=&quot;margin:0 0 34px;&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px;border-bottom:2px solid #dbe6ef;padding-bottom:9px;&quot;&gt;
        &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#2563eb;color:#ffffff;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;&quot;&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;h2 style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:21px;line-height:1.3;color:#102a43;&quot;&gt;Time Series Analysis&lt;/h2&gt;
        &lt;span style=&quot;margin-left:auto;font-size:12px;color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;2 篇&lt;/span&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin:0 0 13px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dbe4ec;border-left:4px solid #3b82f6;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.12857&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#0f4c81;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750;&quot;&gt;Quantifying Perovskite Solar Cell Degradation via Machine Learning from Spatially Resolved Multimodal Luminescence Time Series&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-bottom:11px;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#edf2f7;color:#334155;font-weight:650;&quot;&gt;arXiv&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#dbeafe;color:#1e40af;&quot;&gt;time series analysis&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#64748b;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;低相关&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;time datetime=&quot;2026-06-29&quot; style=&quot;padding:3px 2px;color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;2026-06-29&lt;/time&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:14.5px;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;该研究针对钙钛矿太阳能电池老化状态难以快速、无损评估的问题，利用器件老化过程中的&lt;strong&gt;空间分辨多模态发光时间序列&lt;/strong&gt;预测光电转换效率保持率。作者构建紧凑型卷积神经网络&lt;strong&gt;LumPerNet&lt;/strong&gt;，联合分析电致发光、开路光致发光、短路光致发光及初始参考图像；结果表明，全局发光随时间的演化包含主要预测信息，而空间变化特征可进一步提高退化监测的鲁棒性。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin:0;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dbe4ec;border-left:4px solid #3b82f6;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cell.com/iscience/fulltext/S2589-0042(26)01920-6?rss=yes&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#0f4c81;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750;&quot;&gt;Investigating LST evolution and heatwave patterns using machine learning in the Beijing-Tianjin-Hebei Urban agglomeration&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-bottom:11px;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#edf2f7;color:#334155;font-weight:650;&quot;&gt;iScience&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#dbeafe;color:#1e40af;&quot;&gt;time series analysis&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#64748b;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;低相关&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;time datetime=&quot;2026-06-25&quot; style=&quot;padding:3px 2px;color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;2026-06-25&lt;/time&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:14.5px;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;研究利用&lt;strong&gt;机器学习&lt;/strong&gt;分析京津冀城市群&lt;strong&gt;地表温度&lt;/strong&gt;的时间演变及热浪模式，属于环境时空数据和时间序列分析应用。现有摘要未披露具体数据来源、模型结构、预测任务或定量结果，因此尚无法判断其对热浪变化规律的主要发现及模型性能。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;
    &lt;/section&gt;

    &lt;section style=&quot;margin:0 0 34px;&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px;border-bottom:2px solid #dbe6ef;padding-bottom:9px;&quot;&gt;
        &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#0369a1;color:#ffffff;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;&quot;&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;h2 style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:21px;line-height:1.3;color:#102a43;&quot;&gt;Transfer Learning&lt;/h2&gt;
        &lt;span style=&quot;margin-left:auto;font-size:12px;color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;1 篇&lt;/span&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin:0;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dbe4ec;border-left:4px solid #0284c7;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.04596&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#0f4c81;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750;&quot;&gt;Cross-Platform Autonomous Control of Minimal Kitaev Chains&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-bottom:11px;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#edf2f7;color:#334155;font-weight:650;&quot;&gt;arXiv&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#e0f2fe;color:#075985;&quot;&gt;transfer learning&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#64748b;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;低相关&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;time datetime=&quot;2026-06-25&quot; style=&quot;padding:3px 2px;color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;2026-06-25&lt;/time&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:14.5px;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;该研究利用&lt;strong&gt;跨平台迁移学习&lt;/strong&gt;实现最小Kitaev链中Poor Man’s Majorana零模的自主调谐：先在理论模型上训练，再用二维电子气器件重训练，最后迁移至一维纳米线量子点平台。&lt;strong&gt;卷积神经网络&lt;/strong&gt;根据微分电导预测隧穿与库珀对分裂速率，并据此调节电化学势；算法通常可在45分钟内找到甜点区域，80.9%的尝试达到4.5 mV以内。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;
    &lt;/section&gt;

    &lt;section style=&quot;margin:0 0 34px;&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px;border-bottom:2px solid #dbe6ef;padding-bottom:9px;&quot;&gt;
        &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#0e7490;color:#ffffff;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;&quot;&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;h2 style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:21px;line-height:1.3;color:#102a43;&quot;&gt;Pre-trained Models&lt;/h2&gt;
        &lt;span style=&quot;margin-left:auto;font-size:12px;color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;1 篇&lt;/span&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin:0;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dbe4ec;border-left:4px solid #0891b2;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.25742&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#0f4c81;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750;&quot;&gt;Barocaloric phase transformation from data efficient fine-tuning of machine learned interatomic potentials&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-bottom:11px;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#edf2f7;color:#334155;font-weight:650;&quot;&gt;arXiv&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#cffafe;color:#155e75;&quot;&gt;pre-trained model&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#64748b;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;低相关&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;time datetime=&quot;2026-06-25&quot; style=&quot;padding:3px 2px;color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;2026-06-25&lt;/time&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:14.5px;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;该研究针对机器学习原子间势训练依赖大量DFT数据的问题，比较从头训练与对&lt;strong&gt;MACE-MPA-0预训练基础模型&lt;/strong&gt;进行朴素、多头回放微调的数据效率。结果表明，微调模型仅需&lt;strong&gt;5至10个含60个原子的DFT构型&lt;/strong&gt;即可复现硫酸铵的温度驱动相变，多头回放方案在微调域外还表现出更好的潜在稳健性。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;
    &lt;/section&gt;

    &lt;section style=&quot;margin:0 0 34px;&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px;border-bottom:2px solid #dbe6ef;padding-bottom:9px;&quot;&gt;
        &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#15803d;color:#ffffff;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;&quot;&gt;7&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;h2 style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:21px;line-height:1.3;color:#102a43;&quot;&gt;Crop Health Monitoring&lt;/h2&gt;
        &lt;span style=&quot;margin-left:auto;font-size:12px;color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;1 篇&lt;/span&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin:0;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dbe4ec;border-left:4px solid #22c55e;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://chemrxiv.org/doi/full/10.26434/chemrxiv.15005167/v1?af=R&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#0f4c81;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750;&quot;&gt;PhytoClip: Multimodal Wearable Sensing and Online Machine Learning for Real-Time Plant Health Monitoring and Early Stress Detection&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-bottom:11px;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#edf2f7;color:#334155;font-weight:650;&quot;&gt;ChemRxiv&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#dcfce7;color:#166534;&quot;&gt;crop health monitoring&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;中相关&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;time datetime=&quot;2026-06-25&quot; style=&quot;padding:3px 2px;color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;2026-06-25&lt;/time&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:14.5px;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;该研究针对植物生化与物理状态难以通过单一设备连续、同步监测的问题，提出了可穿戴植物传感系统&lt;strong&gt;PhytoClip&lt;/strong&gt;。系统利用贴附于叶片的&lt;strong&gt;多模态传感贴片&lt;/strong&gt;持续采集温度、湿度等数据，并结合&lt;strong&gt;在线机器学习&lt;/strong&gt;进行实时分析，从而实现植物健康监测和胁迫的早期检测，适用于智能农业中的连续感知与预警。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;
    &lt;/section&gt;

    &lt;section style=&quot;margin:0 0 34px;&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px;border-bottom:2px solid #dbe6ef;padding-bottom:9px;&quot;&gt;
        &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#b45309;color:#ffffff;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;&quot;&gt;8&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;h2 style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:21px;line-height:1.3;color:#102a43;&quot;&gt;Renewable Energy Forecasting&lt;/h2&gt;
        &lt;span style=&quot;margin-left:auto;font-size:12px;color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;1 篇&lt;/span&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin:0;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dbe4ec;border-left:4px solid #f59e0b;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cell.com/iscience/fulltext/S2589-0042(26)01934-6?rss=yes&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#0f4c81;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750;&quot;&gt;Adaptive hybrid deep learning framework for medium-term wind speed forecasting&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-bottom:11px;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#edf2f7;color:#334155;font-weight:650;&quot;&gt;iScience&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;&quot;&gt;renewable energy forecasting&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;中相关&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;time datetime=&quot;2026-06-26&quot; style=&quot;padding:3px 2px;color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;2026-06-26&lt;/time&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:14.5px;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;该研究面向&lt;strong&gt;中期风速预测&lt;/strong&gt;问题，提出&lt;strong&gt;自适应混合深度学习框架&lt;/strong&gt;，对具有时间依赖性和大气变化特征的风速数据进行建模。该方法旨在提升中期预测的准确性与适应能力，可为风能资源评估、风电功率预测及电力系统运行规划提供基础；现有摘要未披露具体模型组件和量化实验结果。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;
    &lt;/section&gt;

    &lt;section style=&quot;margin:0;&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px;border-bottom:2px solid #dbe6ef;padding-bottom:9px;&quot;&gt;
        &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#047857;color:#ffffff;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;&quot;&gt;9&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;h2 style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:21px;line-height:1.3;color:#102a43;&quot;&gt;Energy Storage&lt;/h2&gt;
        &lt;span style=&quot;margin-left:auto;font-size:12px;color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;12 篇&lt;/span&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin:0 0 13px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dbe4ec;border-left:4px solid #10b981;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73852?af=R&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#0f4c81;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750;&quot;&gt;Machine Learning‐Guided High‐Efficiency and Thermally Stable Capacitive Energy Storage in Dielectric Capacitors With a Simple Chemical Composition&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-bottom:11px;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#edf2f7;color:#334155;font-weight:650;&quot;&gt;Adv. Mater.&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#d1fae5;color:#065f46;&quot;&gt;energy storage&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;中相关&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;time datetime=&quot;2026-06-29&quot; style=&quot;padding:3px 2px;color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;2026-06-29&lt;/time&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:14.5px;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;该研究针对介电电容器难以同时实现高储能效率、热稳定性与简单化学组成的问题，利用&lt;strong&gt;机器学习&lt;/strong&gt;指导材料成分或性能优化。结果表明，所设计的&lt;strong&gt;介电材料&lt;/strong&gt;兼具高效储能和良好的热稳定性，为数据驱动的电容储能材料开发提供了新路径；现有摘要未披露具体模型、材料参数及量化性能。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin:0 0 13px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dbe4ec;border-left:4px solid #10b981;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.27887&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#0f4c81;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750;&quot;&gt;Unlocking Cryogenic Energy Storage by Constructing Dipole Glass with Unit-cell-level Polar Disorder&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-bottom:11px;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#edf2f7;color:#334155;font-weight:650;&quot;&gt;arXiv&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#d1fae5;color:#065f46;&quot;&gt;energy storage&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;中相关&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;time datetime=&quot;2026-06-29&quot; style=&quot;padding:3px 2px;color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;2026-06-29&lt;/time&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:14.5px;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;该研究针对传统电化学储能在约230 K以下离子迁移冻结、弛豫铁电电容器在深低温下损耗增大的问题，在&lt;strong&gt;Pb0.6Sr0.4ZrO3薄膜&lt;/strong&gt;中构建晶胞尺度极性无序的&lt;strong&gt;偶极玻璃态&lt;/strong&gt;。该设计抑制长程铁电有序，使器件在低至&lt;strong&gt;4 K&lt;/strong&gt;时仍保持超过&lt;strong&gt;88%&lt;/strong&gt;的效率，并在9 MV/cm下达到&lt;strong&gt;211 J/cm³&lt;/strong&gt;的储能密度，同时具备超过&lt;strong&gt;10^8次循环&lt;/strong&gt;稳定性和微秒级充放电能力。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin:0 0 13px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dbe4ec;border-left:4px solid #10b981;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.24480&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#0f4c81;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750;&quot;&gt;Breaking Bottlenecks in Solid Electrolyte Discovery with Large Artificial Intelligence Models&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-bottom:11px;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#edf2f7;color:#334155;font-weight:650;&quot;&gt;arXiv&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#d1fae5;color:#065f46;&quot;&gt;energy storage&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;中相关&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;time datetime=&quot;2026-06-24&quot; style=&quot;padding:3px 2px;color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;2026-06-24&lt;/time&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:14.5px;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;该论文针对固态电池固体电解质发现中数据碎片化、模拟迁移能力有限和实验迭代缓慢等瓶颈，提出由&lt;strong&gt;机器学习原子间势（MLIPs）&lt;/strong&gt;与&lt;strong&gt;大语言模型（LLMs）&lt;/strong&gt;驱动的自主材料发现框架。该框架将候选材料设计、多尺度模拟、不确定性感知筛选和实验验证整合为闭环，并利用大语言模型开展文献挖掘、假设生成与科学推理，为构建可自我更新的固态电池材料自主实验室提供设计原则。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin:0 0 13px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dbe4ec;border-left:4px solid #10b981;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.00236&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#0f4c81;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750;&quot;&gt;Subsurface Vacancy Engineering Enables Atomically Clean and Oxidation-Resistant Copper Interfaces for Anode-Free Lithium Metal Batteries&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-bottom:11px;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#edf2f7;color:#334155;font-weight:650;&quot;&gt;arXiv&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#d1fae5;color:#065f46;&quot;&gt;energy storage&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;中相关&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;time datetime=&quot;2026-06-24&quot; style=&quot;padding:3px 2px;color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;2026-06-24&lt;/time&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:14.5px;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;该研究面向无负极锂金属电池中铜集流体易氧化、锂沉积不均和界面副反应等问题，采用&lt;strong&gt;铜离子注入&lt;/strong&gt;构建原子级洁净且抗氧化的表面下空位结构。实验与多尺度模拟表明，&lt;strong&gt;空位簇&lt;/strong&gt;可捕获氧、提高界面电导并诱导形成超薄富&lt;strong&gt;Li2O&lt;/strong&gt;固态电解质界面，从而实现均匀锂沉积；在贫电解液条件下，电池经过&lt;strong&gt;600次循环&lt;/strong&gt;仍达到&lt;strong&gt;98.8%&lt;/strong&gt;的库仑效率。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin:0 0 13px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dbe4ec;border-left:4px solid #94a3b8;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/SC/D5SC09834C&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#0f4c81;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750;&quot;&gt;Superionic Lithium Mobility in Low Symmetry Li7Si2S7I Polymorph Accessed via Si2S7 Dimer Reorientation&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-bottom:11px;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#edf2f7;color:#334155;font-weight:650;&quot;&gt;Chem&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#d1fae5;color:#065f46;&quot;&gt;energy storage&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#64748b;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;低相关&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;time datetime=&quot;2026-06-25&quot; style=&quot;padding:3px 2px;color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;2026-06-25&lt;/time&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:14.5px;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;该研究面向固态电池对高离子电导固体电解质的需求，实验发现了三斜晶系&lt;strong&gt;Li7Si2S7I0.89Cl0.11&lt;/strong&gt;，其结构是单斜晶&lt;strong&gt;Li7Si2S7I&lt;/strong&gt;的低对称性类似物。研究通过&lt;strong&gt;Si2S7二聚体重取向&lt;/strong&gt;获得这一多晶型，并表明其保留了较高的Li+迁移能力，为固态锂电池电解质的结构调控提供了新路径。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin:0 0 13px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dbe4ec;border-left:4px solid #94a3b8;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71218?af=R&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#0f4c81;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750;&quot;&gt;Ultrathin, Tough Asymmetric MOF‐Based Separator Enabling Rapid Selective Ion Transport and Stable Aqueous Zn‐Ion Batteries&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-bottom:11px;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#edf2f7;color:#334155;font-weight:650;&quot;&gt;Adv. Energy Mater.&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#d1fae5;color:#065f46;&quot;&gt;energy storage&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#64748b;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;低相关&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;time datetime=&quot;2026-06-25&quot; style=&quot;padding:3px 2px;color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;2026-06-25&lt;/time&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:14.5px;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;该研究针对水系锌离子电池中隔膜机械强度、厚度和离子选择性传输难以兼顾的问题，开发了超薄且高韧的非对称&lt;strong&gt;金属有机框架（MOF）隔膜&lt;/strong&gt;。该隔膜能够促进快速、选择性的离子迁移并提升电池运行稳定性，为高性能水系储能器件的隔膜设计提供了方案。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin:0 0 13px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dbe4ec;border-left:4px solid #94a3b8;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://chemrxiv.org/doi/full/10.26434/chemrxiv.15005103/v2?af=R&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#0f4c81;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750;&quot;&gt;Co-solvent enhanced solvation shell lability improves ion transport in Li-ion battery electrolytes&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-bottom:11px;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#edf2f7;color:#334155;font-weight:650;&quot;&gt;ChemRxiv&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#d1fae5;color:#065f46;&quot;&gt;energy storage&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#64748b;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;低相关&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;time datetime=&quot;2026-06-25&quot; style=&quot;padding:3px 2px;color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;2026-06-25&lt;/time&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:14.5px;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;该研究关注锂离子电池极快充电电解液中高离子电导率与有利Li+迁移特性难以同步实现的问题。作者采用&lt;strong&gt;共溶剂&lt;/strong&gt;调控&lt;strong&gt;Li+溶剂化壳层&lt;/strong&gt;并提高其动态易变性，从而改善碳酸酯基电解液中的离子传输，为极快充锂电池电解液设计提供了分子层面的优化策略。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin:0 0 13px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dbe4ec;border-left:4px solid #94a3b8;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://chemrxiv.org/doi/full/10.26434/chemrxiv.15005178/v1?af=R&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#0f4c81;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750;&quot;&gt;Induced Structural Disorder Enables High Ionic Conductivity and Capacity in Li2Fe1−xMnxCl4 Cathodes&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-bottom:11px;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#edf2f7;color:#334155;font-weight:650;&quot;&gt;ChemRxiv&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#d1fae5;color:#065f46;&quot;&gt;energy storage&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#64748b;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;低相关&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;time datetime=&quot;2026-06-25&quot; style=&quot;padding:3px 2px;color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;2026-06-25&lt;/time&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:14.5px;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;该研究针对高能量密度固态电池需要兼具高容量和离子传导能力的正极活性材料这一问题，考察了&lt;strong&gt;Li2Fe1−xMnxCl4氯化物正极&lt;/strong&gt;。作者通过成分调节诱导&lt;strong&gt;结构无序&lt;/strong&gt;，提升材料的离子电导率和容量，使其有望支持更高比例的正极活性材料装载并减少复合电极中的非活性组分。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin:0 0 13px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dbe4ec;border-left:4px solid #94a3b8;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(26)00223-0?rss=yes&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#0f4c81;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750;&quot;&gt;Contact loss in all-solid-state Li-ion batteries via deposition of impurities&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-bottom:11px;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#edf2f7;color:#334155;font-weight:650;&quot;&gt;Joule&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#d1fae5;color:#065f46;&quot;&gt;energy storage&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#64748b;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;低相关&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;time datetime=&quot;2026-06-25&quot; style=&quot;padding:3px 2px;color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;2026-06-25&lt;/time&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:14.5px;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;研究全固态锂离子电池中锂负极—固态电解质界面的接触损失机制，并对“原生锂形成空洞”的传统解释提出补充。结果表明，锂负极内部的&lt;strong&gt;绝缘杂质&lt;/strong&gt;会在剥离过程中向界面富集，形成多孔且机械稳定的阻隔层并阻碍锂通量，说明控制&lt;strong&gt;负极纯度和界面杂质&lt;/strong&gt;是提升固态电池稳定性的关键。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin:0 0 13px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dbe4ec;border-left:4px solid #94a3b8;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://pubs.aip.org/aip/apl/article/128/25/253904/3396426/High-frequency-AC-line-filtering-with-silicon&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#0f4c81;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750;&quot;&gt;High-frequency AC line filtering with silicon carbide-based flexible supercapacitors&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-bottom:11px;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#edf2f7;color:#334155;font-weight:650;&quot;&gt;Appl. Phys. Lett.&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#d1fae5;color:#065f46;&quot;&gt;energy storage&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#64748b;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;低相关&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;time datetime=&quot;2026-06-25&quot; style=&quot;padding:3px 2px;color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;2026-06-25&lt;/time&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:14.5px;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;针对传统铝电解电容器体积较大以及超级电容器高频响应不足的问题，研究采用无黏结剂磁控溅射制备具有纳米花椰菜多孔结构的&lt;strong&gt;碳化硅薄膜柔性对称超级电容器&lt;/strong&gt;。器件实现&lt;strong&gt;3.2 kHz&lt;/strong&gt;特征频率、120 Hz下&lt;strong&gt;0.67 F cm⁻³&lt;/strong&gt;体积电容和25000次循环后&lt;strong&gt;84.39%&lt;/strong&gt;的性能保持率，并将50 Hz交流信号的输出波动降至&lt;strong&gt;80 mV&lt;/strong&gt;，显著低于铝电解电容器的360 mV。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin:0 0 13px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dbe4ec;border-left:4px solid #94a3b8;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70981?af=R&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#0f4c81;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750;&quot;&gt;Suppressing Dissolution of Solid Electrolyte Interphase Enables Highly Stable Sodium‐Ion Batteries&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-bottom:11px;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#edf2f7;color:#334155;font-weight:650;&quot;&gt;Adv. Energy Mater.&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#d1fae5;color:#065f46;&quot;&gt;energy storage&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#64748b;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;低相关&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;time datetime=&quot;2026-06-24&quot; style=&quot;padding:3px 2px;color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;2026-06-24&lt;/time&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:14.5px;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;研究聚焦钠离子电池&lt;strong&gt;固体电解质界面膜（SEI）&lt;/strong&gt;溶解所引发的界面不稳定问题，并以抑制SEI溶解作为提高循环稳定性的核心策略。所给摘要仅包含题名和出版信息，未说明具体电解液或界面设计、实验方法及寿命提升幅度，因而无法进一步评估其性能增益。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin:0;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dbe4ec;border-left:4px solid #94a3b8;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adfm.76704?af=R&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#0f4c81;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750;&quot;&gt;Physical/Chemical Mismatch Elimination Enabling Ultra‐Uniform Composite Solid Electrolyte for High Performance Solid‐State Lithium Metal Batteries&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-bottom:11px;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#edf2f7;color:#334155;font-weight:650;&quot;&gt;Adv. Funct. Mater.&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#d1fae5;color:#065f46;&quot;&gt;energy storage&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#64748b;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;低相关&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;time datetime=&quot;2026-06-24&quot; style=&quot;padding:3px 2px;color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;2026-06-24&lt;/time&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:14.5px;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;研究针对固态锂金属电池中复合固态电解质的物理与化学失配问题，提出&lt;strong&gt;失配消除策略&lt;/strong&gt;以构建&lt;strong&gt;超均匀复合电解质&lt;/strong&gt;并改善电池性能。现有摘要未提供材料组成、制备流程、界面表征以及循环寿命或倍率性能等定量结果，因此其具体改进机制和效果仍无法由给定信息判断。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;
    &lt;/section&gt;
  &lt;/main&gt;

